# Local runtime state — never commit
# Covered by the glob, listed explicitly so the daemon's state surface is legible:
#   .phoenicurus_prepare_last_run    daily idempotency stamp (scheduled path)
#   .phoenicurus_prepare_last_sha    per-commit idempotency stamp (--on-merge)
#   .phoenicurus_prepare_last_spawn  last spawned agent, for --check-agent-outcome
#   .phoenicurus_prepare_retry_after usage-limit retry deadline + attempt count
#   .phoenicurus_prepare_auth_notify auth-failure notification rate limit
.phoenicurus_*
*.log
.npmrc-phoenicurus-*
